WEBVTT

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.330
So I guess this is a hot spring?

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.680
Smart ball pinball, a shooting 
game, hot spring dumplings...

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.720
The more I see, the more it's 
obviously a hot spring resort.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.190
Is this really a different world?

00:01:59.190 --> 00:02:00.780
The Tamatsukure Hot Spring...

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.720
This is the area's most 
famous Alma hot spring.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.480
Alma hot spring?

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.790
It's supposed to be 
great for your skin!

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:09.830
I can't wait!

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:12.480
Can you please not say stuff 
like that in that low voice?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.980
And that's not all!

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.360
It's supposed to be very 
effective against back pain,

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.610
rheumatism and for restoring the libido.

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:22.480
I see.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.130
What's that supposed to mean?

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.580
You have a problem?

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.920
Nah, I was just thinking that it sucks that

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.730
we made it to a hot spring 
but it's going to be totally unsexy

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.480
because we've only 
got dudes and a kid.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.040
You're such a child.

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:35.920
What are you talking about?

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:39.560
This town isn't just famous 
for it's hot spring, though.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:44.070
It's also known for offering 
a plethora of services.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:47.660
So stuff like being able to 
get a companion for parties,

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:50.580
bars where the hostesses 
lie about their age,

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.190
and even sex museums?

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.340
He's really getting excited.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.040
Nothing he's babbling 
about makes sense.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.750
He seems to have a lot of 
secondhand information on sex.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.770
Shut up!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.200
I don't need to hear it from 
the newhalf and the kid.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.970
Hey, Kon, look over there.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:09.830
That's...

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.690
The playground for gentlemen.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:16.460
If you've got a desire, 
they've got a place to satisfy it.

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.590
Um, your nostrils are flaring.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.880
Why don't you go, too?

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.740
You know, for future reference.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.300
You won't know what to 
do when it comes down to it

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.530
if all you have is 
secondhand information.

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.600
I'll think about it.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:32.750
We're here.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.840
This is the Tamatsukure 
Hot Spring's Jewell Inn.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.450
I keep saying this, but is this 
really a different world?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.150
Welcome.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:47.990
Welcome!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.870
You are all with Sainglain-sama, 
is that correct?

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.570
Let me show you the way.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:53.580
Follow me, please.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.540
If things keep progressing this way,

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.380
they'll even have a nice milk coffee

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.590
after you get out of your bath.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.030
I can't wait!

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.470
My skin is already tingling.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:02.790
That reminds me...

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:04.530
Which bath will you be using, sis?

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.500
The male bath? The female bath?

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.890
They're not going to have a trans bath.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.310
Don't worry about it.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.070
We've got a special room with its own

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:17.420
outdoor bath for the 
princess and Mariandel.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.820
I could get used to this.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.820
What about us?

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:25.820
This is us.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.570
This is tiny!

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:30.810
Hey, that's discrimination!

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.380
We are knights and thus forbidden

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.080
to indulge in immoderation and luxuries.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.350
I guess it beats camping.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:38.100
Right then.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.190
Want to go?

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.800
That was fast!

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.300
Where are you going?

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:45.780
You have to ask?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.680
What a foolish question.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.790
Hey, Kon!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.530
Didn't they teach you in your world

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.200
that you shouldn't 
jump into a hot spring

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.800
or swim around in one?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.710
Sorry, but I can't help it!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:12.040
Finally, I can stretch out 
my legs and take a bath.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.970
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:24.600
You're a knight. Behave yourself.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:29.140
Hey, come on! 
This is really humiliating!

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.650
Simmer down and be quiet.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.150
I guess the warm comfort 
is the same as back home.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.660
Does it remind you of your home?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.110
Not really.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.940
I mean, I only ever went to 
hot springs with my family,

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:54.970
so it's not like I have a 
big attachment to the idea.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:58.430
And basically, only old people 
really go to hot springs.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:01.830
Use this time to rest 
your mind and body.

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:06.900
You never know when we'll be plunged 
into a fierce battle again.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.310
I keep praying that that won't happen.

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.600
Too true.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.600
Huh?

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.770
Wh-What?!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.320
Is something wrong?

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:21.800
N-No!

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:22.780
I'm fine!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.810
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.680
<i>It would make sense if 
this was a woman's bath</i>

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:29.130
<i>or if Sainglain was a woman with 
some kind of otherworldly beauty,</i>

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.860
<i>but since that's not the case,</i>

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:33.620
<i>why the hell is my Clara getting up?</i>

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.280
<i>Don't tell me</i>

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:38.120
<i>I'm getting excited because of 
this muscle-headed old man?!</i>

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.700
<i>That's ridiculous!</i>

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.500
<i>I must be crushing on</i>

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.630
<i>that rock or that wash
 bucket or that shampoo...</i>

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.580
<i>What the hell am I talking about?</i>

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.240
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.220
Uh, Kon?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.310
I told you, I'm fine!

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:53.620
Can you just give me some space?

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.680
I'm kind of busy right now.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.620
That's right, I just remembered 
something I need to do.

00:06:58.620 --> 00:06:59.930
I'm going to get out first.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:01.720
You just relax.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:02.290
Bye!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.480
Hey, Kon!

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.980
Jeez, what the hell was that about?

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.030
I'm not fit to be in 
public in this state.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.560
What the...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:15.330
<i>...supposed to be very effective 
in restoring the libido.</i>

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.620
Now I get it!

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:19.190
Hang on.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:21.140
That still doesn't make sense.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.630
If that were the case, 
he should've been feeling it, too.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.510
Anyway, thinking won't 
help me figure this out.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:28.880
I guess I'll just have to hang 
around here until it goes aw—

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.580
Wh-What is Erec doing here, of all places?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.000
Why does the person

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.320
I want to see the least in this 
world have to pop up here?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.960
This way, please.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:52.760
Thank you.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.320
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.580
<i>I've gotten into many mortal 
struggles with him already.</i>

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.580
<i>Each time, I honestly thought 
I was going to die.</i>

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:06.210
<i>I still don't understand 
how I ever defeated him.</i>

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.160
<i>That's why I'm certain.</i>

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:12.020
<i>Were we to fight again, 
I can confidently say that I'd lose!</i>

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.800
<i>We can't run into each other.</i>

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.590
<i>I've got to do something!</i>

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:20.600
"I'll be fine on my own from here," huh?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.600
Well, I guess I'd get in his way 
if he wants to enjoy himself.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:29.110
Why don't I just go to 
another hot spring instead?

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:34.670
If I hide out in my room, 
I won't run into him.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.650
Oh no, it's locked.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:41.090
Crap. I forgot to get 
the key from Sainglain.

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:42.410
This way please.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:43.020
Thank you.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.140
<i>I can't keep doing this.</i>

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.890
There's no way I can do this 
without paying a price.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.340
First I have to get out of sight.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:06.100
Hey, sis! Princess? It's me!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.770
Lemme in!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:09.250
This is an emergency!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.640
In more ways than one, 
this is an emergency!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.500
Hey! Sis!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:15.430
Princess!

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:17.030
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.550
Ah, this is just marvelous.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.930
Princess, shall I pour 
water on your back?

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.220
I'll do it myself.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.040
But I'll call for a masseuse later.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.470
Oh, you don't want a 
full spa treatment?

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.450
Hey! Are you listening?!

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.770
I know you two are in there!

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:37.010
This is bad, it's worse than 
your three day constipation!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:40.050
If this isn't taken care of 
soon, it'll really be bad!

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.020
So please, open up!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:46.920
Oh, I'm not asking that you 
do something about it.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:48.060
So please, just let me in!

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:49.350
I am so sorry.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:52.450
Your room isn't actually there, 
it's over here.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:54.510
Please follow me.

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:55.660
Thank you.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.710
What is this?

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.230
If I can't get to them,

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.710
then I'll have to ask 
the old geezer for help.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.100
Hey! Old timer!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.610
Now where the hell did he go?

00:10:24.420 --> 00:10:25.350
Don't even tell me...

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.230
<i>...The playground for gentlemen.</i>

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:31.230
<i>If you've got a desire, 
they've got a place to satisfy it.</i>

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:37.080
That damn musclehead snuck out 
to the gentlemen's playground!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.010
And he leaves at a time like this!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.700
<i>Can you stop showing 
up everywhere I go?</i>

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.360
<i>You're really starting 
to be a pain in my ass!</i>

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.000
<i>Am I cursed or something?</i>

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.890
<i>With him and... That.</i>

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.450
<i>All right. Here's my chance.</i>

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:14.290
God of Alma!

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:15.610
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:19.280
I beseech thee!

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.610
This is my most pressing wish, 
so please, please...

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:29.120
Please bestow my soldier 
with power again!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:33.630
Miracle of Alma! Help my soldier!

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:37.380
<i>I can't even laugh.</i>

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:37.380
Breathe life back into it.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:43.640
It's no use.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.720
This feels great.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:49.140
We'd like a thirty-minute extension.

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:52.560
I would like to leave a message
for Sainglain's expensive suite.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.200
Tell them that Kon says they are not

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:56.560
to leave their room 
under any circumstances!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.150
I'll tell them.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.450
I guess those two will be fine now.

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.640
Make sure you tell them!

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:06.410
Bye.

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.850
That back... I feel like 
I've seen him before.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.620
Nah. There's no way he would be here.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:26.030
The first thing I need to 
do is get myself under

00:12:26.030 --> 00:12:28.240
the geezer's protection 
before he finds me.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:34.220
The geezer is in there somewhere!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.520
Hey, young man, 
you looking for a good time?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.720
We've got plenty of cute girls.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.980
Actually, what I'm looking 
for right now is

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.340
a totally uncute old geezer.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:49.930
You look like a virile young man.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.300
Why don't you step in, 
we'll treat you right.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.920
I'm not in this state by choice.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:57.270
Finding the geezer here

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.920
is going to be like finding 
a needle in a haystack.

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:04.220
It's not like I can go into 
each and every place to check.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.890
That customer just now 
was really funny, huh?

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.370
Yeah.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.260
That's it!

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:16.450
Randomly searching for him won't work.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:19.190
I need to analyze his fetishes 
and then home in on

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:21.690
places where he might be based on that.

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.700
And the geezer is a furry.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.370
For a normal person, that would be

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.310
a place with girls in animal costumes.

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:33.640
But he's hardcore.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.080
He wouldn't be satisfied with some 
half-assed animal costume, not at all.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:37.110
And that means...

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.090
There's no mistake, 
this must be the right track.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:45.130
Much better chances than 
looking in normal places...

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:46.340
That's...

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:53.390
Excuse me.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.400
I have a question about this place.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.040
What then, my strapping lad?

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:58.850
You don't know this place?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.810
<i>You can leave off the "strapping."</i>

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.230
But anyway, about this place...

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.470
A lot of people are talking about it.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.860
It's a place where you can drink 
while you play with cats.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:18.090
Here cute, little kitty kitty.

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:25.400
What the hell do you think you're 
doing here at a time like this?!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.580
What? That Erec is here?

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:29.640
That's really bad!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.830
That's why I was running around 
all over in my embarrassing state,

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.810
expending massive amounts of energy,

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:37.350
suffering immensely,  
just to find your ass!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.300
I see. So you went through 
all that trouble to find me.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.810
So what you're saying is you 
want me to be your second,

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.170
so you can finally put an 
end to this with a duel?

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.350
Hell no!

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:46.970
Then why did you get me?

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.570
Because I want to somehow 
avoid running into him!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.610
Don't you get it?!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.620
Looks like he's gone.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.660
Why does he have to show 
up everywhere I go?!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.230
Is he doing it on purpose?

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:15.040
I guess that's cured, at least.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:18.640
I was getting sick of taking 
the little shogun around.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.520
Yes!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.770
Problem solved!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:26.650
I don't have to walk around 
 like a beaten dog anymore.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.300
Hey, Kon.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.150
Huh?

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.160
Your body is glowing.

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.490
What the hell?!

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.050
Just what the hell is going on here?

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:41.170
Why do I have to attract

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.380
everybody's attention 
right now, of all times?

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.920
First things first, 
let's get back to our room.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.800
Walking around like this is basically 
begging to be discovered.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.400
I'm so tired.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.650
Looks like we made it somehow.

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.830
Says the guy who was relaxing all day!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.310
What are you going to do now?

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:04.710
Do now?

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:05.810
That's a stupid question.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.910
There's nothing else you 
can do at a time like this

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:12.240
besides spread out your futon 
and sleep. Good night.

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:22.370
Um. You're really bright.

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:25.750
It's not like I'm <i>trying</i> to be bright!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:30.020
It doesn't look like it's 
going to fade anytime soon.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.760
This is a problem.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:35.970
Can't you just ignore it for tonight?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.040
Think about it.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:41.110
What if the glow won't fade?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:44.410
What if you keep glowing 
for the rest of your life?

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:46.490
What do you propose to do?

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.980
Interview Room

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.400
If I continue to glow...

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.490
Can you tell us why you're 
applying to work with us?

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.520
Yes.

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.460
Your company's corporate spirit

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:58.740
and policies really speak to me.

00:16:58.740 --> 00:16:59.870
I see.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.570
And why are you glowing?

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.500
I was born this way.

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:05.480
You can leave.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:07.070
I'm not ever going to make it

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:09.230
through a job interview 
looking like this!

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:11.760
I won't be able to donate blood either.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:13.760
I'm type O.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.360
I'm sorry, but we don't 
need glowing blood.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:17.990
Does that mean I don't 
get a glass of milk?

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:23.140
Kon-kun, I'm shy, can you 
please turn the light off?

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.890
I'm sorry. I can't turn this off.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:26.600
Fail.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:29.400
This is way too awkward!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:35.280
Like I'd even get that far with 
a girl if I'm always glowing.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.720
Now I understand how 
hard it is to always

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.720
be in a state of heightened 
attack power,

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.880
to always be on monster power pills.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.010
The reason Goku only 
showed his full power

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:49.920
in very select situations 
is this very reason.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.800
If you're always glowing, 
your everyday life is affected!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.470
I'll be back.

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.300
Hey, Kon!

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.180
<i>I'm starting to understand it a little.</i>

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:05.640
<i>This is all because of 
these Alma hot springs.</i>

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.190
<i>First when I got in with the geezer.</i>

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.900
<i>Then, when I put my feet in.</i>

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:13.160
<i>The reason I'm the only one affected</i>

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.750
<i>is because I'm a Hyperion.</i>

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:20.160
<i>I suppose Erec's also here 
because of this effect.</i>

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:23.260
<i>I don't know what will happen 
if I get in a third time.</i>

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:26.620
<i>But if I don't do something 
about this glow,</i>

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.170
<i>I'm going to be a virgin 
for the rest of my life,</i>

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:32.170
<i>and I'll do anything to avoid that!</i>

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:40.680
So?

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:43.970
It worked!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.940
Just like I thought!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.630
I don't know what's 
going to happen now

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:49.480
but anything is better than glowing.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.400
I thought that was you.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.020
Erec!

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:56.650
I never thought 
I'd meet you again here!

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:57.950
DT!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.120
What the hell are you doing here?

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.940
Didn't you just have a bath?

00:19:02.940 --> 00:19:04.580
W-Were you watching me?

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.340
I wouldn't say watching, per se.

00:19:06.340 --> 00:19:09.900
And I didn't see anything important, 
or hear anything...

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.060
Silence!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:15.130
I don't have to explain when 
and where I take my bath!

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.630
But that doesn't matter. 
Fight me, DT!

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.180
We're going to put an 
end to this matter.

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:22.170
Now, just a minute!

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.610
This is a hot spring!

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:25.970
Didn't you come here for 
some rest and relaxation?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:29.820
Someone said that pointless 
battles only end in sadness.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:32.730
And will you please 
stop calling me DT?!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.080
I won't let you talk your 
way out of this anymore!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.120
And your words are empty. I mean look,

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.360
your body is already 
getting ready to fight.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:42.270
What are you talking about?

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:43.200
Huh?

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:46.200
I'm even brighter than before!

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:49.260
The glow of Alma proves it!

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:50.460
Here we go!

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:51.980
Hang on!

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:53.530
It's not what it looks like.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.290
The hell it isn't!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.740
Your very existence is a 
provocation against me!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.720
Provocation? But I...

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:07.970
Why does this have to happen 
with this delicate guy around?!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:12.400
<i>As far as results go, I couldn't 
have hoped for a worse one.</i>

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:16.970
<i>In this state, anything I say will 
 just provoke him further.</i>

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.480
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.980
I'm done talking to you.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:22.520
Here I go!

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.360
Stay back!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:24.320
Wait!

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.160
Are you afraid all of a sudden, DT?

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.140
I'm afraid!

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.420
Let me go!

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:30.250
Never!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:32.980
Then why do you even bother asking?!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.130
I told you before,

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:36.000
there isn't anything you can say!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.300
Fine, fine.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.510
But will you at least 
listen to my opinion?

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.010
Your opinion?

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.980
Think about it.

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:45.490
If we fight here,

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.820
the damage to this hot spring 
will be irreversible.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.400
Not only will we cause a lot of 
trouble for the proprietress here,

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:53.260
the loser will also die buck naked.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:54.810
Don't you think that's 
a pretty cruel ending,

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.040
no matter which one of 
us it ends up being?

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.920
The body will have to be cleaned up

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.840
by the proprietress or her workers here.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:04.790
And once word gets out 
that someone died here,

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:06.670
it's obvious that this place would

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:08.700
start to suffer financial 
losses, as well!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.700
Y-You're right.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.570
You're a warrior, too.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:16.820
Let's at least put on some clothes.

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:19.540
Fine.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:24.020
But listen.

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.020
Once we're clad, we're continuing 
right where we left off.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.470
A man always keeps his word.

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:51.990
One moment.

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:54.000
I'll be dressed in a moment.

00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:58.050
<i>Sorry, Erec,</i>

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:01.000
<i>but I'm starting as soon 
as I've got my clothes on.</i>

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.510
DT, bring it on?

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:09.380
Please come again!

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:14.770
I wanted to take another bath.

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:18.400
You've always had smooth 
skin, so you're fine.

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:21.810
That place is famous for 
its sumptuous meals.

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:24.400
I thought knights were supposed 
to avoid all luxuries!

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:26.070
For a servant, 
you've got a lot of nerve

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:29.300
making me walk in the 
middle of the dark night.

00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:37.200
That's why I'm illuminating 
the road for you!

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.580 --> 00:24:12.030
What the hell is going on?

00:24:12.030 --> 00:24:14.720
It's been a week and I'm still glowing!

00:24:14.720 --> 00:24:16.360
Shouldn't this type of thing

00:24:16.360 --> 00:24:18.430
reset itself by the next week?

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:20.740
Hey, I'm not a god!

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:23.360
Or am I? A god?

00:24:24.920 --> 00:24:29.820
In a certain village, Kon, whose glow

00:24:24.920 --> 00:24:29.820
would not subside, is mistaken for a god.

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:35.180
Why is Kon glowing?

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:35.180
It's probably the "Mysterious Power of Alma." (LOL)
